  "StockRole": "Brawler",
  "YangsThoughts": "The Aries is a Star Adder assault OmniMech produced on Arcadia, with a possible secondary facility near their invasion corridor. It merges the banned Osteon's design with elements from the Blood Asp, offering 56 tons of pod space - matching the Tomahawk II. Though lacking Ferro-Lamelor armor, its durability and adaptability make it a serious threat. Reports indicate up to 16 variants, each capable of engaging at any range with ballistic, missile, and energy loadouts. Some variants show exceptional endurance and heat resistance, staying active under conditions that would disable most 'Mechs. The Aries should be considered a top-tier battlefield threat.",
